    "document": "Combat Patrol",
    "section": "01. Combat Patrol Mission Sequence",
    "ruleNumber": "01.11",
    "summary": "Compare VP when play ends. The higher total wins, with equal totals producing a draw. Each side follows its own Combat Patrol mission to earn VP. Add 10 VP for an army painted to Battle Ready standard. For a newcomer in their first few outings with the patrol, the advice is to skip the painting bonus. The painting bonus still applies at Combat Patrol events.",
